  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:05:44.343Z",
  "id": 203981877933438,
  "uuid": "a1c0b666-95a2-4afa-885e-e2ab49009f58",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "130932ff-d370-bcf3-4a80-c990157e28dd",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "df4ab4eb-de71-e5b9-f993-451556963f09",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "A student in the programme's fourth cohort, John scooped the Governance Reporting Award for his story on ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "'Heir to Sh2 billion estate dragged through courts for 24 years",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.standardmedia.co.ke/kenya/article/2001399051/the-24-year-fight-for-sh2b-estate",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "', and was a finalist for the Gender Reporting Award for his story on '",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Divorce formalities don't have to tie you down",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.standardmedia.co.ke/nairobi/article/2001364778/judge-divorce-formalities-dont-have-to-tie-you-down",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "', both in the print category.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I am excited and grateful that I won the governance award as it means a lot to me and came at a time that I had just healed from Covid-19. I am grateful to my lecturers for the training and inspiration,\" he said.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "He aspires to create a multimedia story to include a podcast and video in his next submission using skills garnered from the MADJ classes.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The awards are a continuous annual celebration of journalistic excellence and achievement in Kenya.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Congratulations John!",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "To learn more about the MADJ programme, ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "CLICK HERE",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/gsmc/Pages/ma-digital-journalism.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
